  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nThe matrix - is a decentralised IM-service for world. But it need centralised certs. Today \"certs system\" is block some countries - for example: Iran, Irak, Russia, Noth Korean and other. What we will see in future? \r\nToday, if I want setup synapse server for my freands - I need pay cert. Some free certs distributors is not release certs for some countries, some - not working with webrtc in android and chrome (Let's encrypt). \r\n\r\nThe situation with certs - is more centralised, then situation with migration accounts between servers. This is not free conception. \r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\n\r\nI think will be nice - return concept working with self-signed certs.",
